From d57bd92565ef7bd8c6cec8c3c02a31af961e17df Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 13:34:11 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] vulkan: fix flash attention Q8_1 shared-memory write out of
 bounds

The Q quantize block of flash_attn.comp wrote Qf[] for rows r >= Br, past the
shared array. The write is now guarded by r < Br; the clustered row-sum moves
outside the guard so every lane of the cluster still takes part (Q8_0 K passes
a zero sum and never uses it).

Test: upstream ships none. An out-of-bounds shared write is undefined behaviour
with no deterministic failure on AMD, so no RED arm is claimed; GREEN = the full
FLASH_ATTN_EXT gate (q8_0/q4_0/q4_1/q5_0/q5_1 K) passes.

Taken-from: ggml-org/llama.cpp@6c59c40076 (#29988)
Origin: upstream-x1 lane PORT-SPEC P3
Measured-effect: UNMEASURED (correctness; FLASH_ATTN_EXT gate in MERGE-READY.md row P3)
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../ggml-vulkan/vulkan-shaders/flash_attn.comp  | 17 ++++++-----------
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/vulkan-shaders/flash_attn.comp b/ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/vulkan-shaders/flash_attn.comp
index db87ccb40b..aab8911180 100644
--- a/ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/vulkan-shaders/flash_attn.comp
+++ b/ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/vulkan-shaders/flash_attn.comp
@@ -134,20 +134,15 @@ void main() {
         const float qd_inv = qd != 0.0f ? 1.0f / qd : 0.0f;
         vals = round(vals * qd_inv);
 
-        Qf[buf_ib].qs[buf_iqs] = pack32(i8vec4(vals));
+        const float thread_sum = vals.x + vals.y + vals.z + vals.w;
+        // Q8_0 K does not use the row sum.
+        const float sum = FaTypeK == GGML_TYPE_Q8_0 ? 0.0f : subgroupClusteredAdd(thread_sum, 8);
 
-        // Q8_0 K only needs (qd, _); the asymmetric Q4_*/Q5_* family also stores
-        // the row-sum scaled by qd, used in k_dot_correction.
-        if (FaTypeK == GGML_TYPE_Q8_0) {
-            if (buf_iqs == 0) {
-                Qf[buf_ib].ds = FLOAT_TYPEV2(qd, 0.0f);
-            }
-        } else {
-            const float thread_sum = vals.x + vals.y + vals.z + vals.w;
-            const float sum = subgroupClusteredAdd(thread_sum, 8);
+        if (r < Br) {
+            Qf[buf_ib].qs[buf_iqs] = pack32(i8vec4(vals));
 
             if (buf_iqs == 0) {
-                Qf[buf_ib].ds = FLOAT_TYPEV2(qd, sum * qd);
+                Qf[buf_ib].ds = FaTypeK == GGML_TYPE_Q8_0 ? FLOAT_TYPEV2(qd, 0.0f) : FLOAT_TYPEV2(qd, sum * qd);
             }
         }
 #endif
